{
  "source": "UAMS-Web/uams-claude-skills",
  "note": "Written by scripts/sync.mjs in the source repository. Lists every file the sync manages here so the next sync can remove one the routing drops, with the sha256 of each so .claude/skills/synced-files/scripts/check-synced-files.mjs can catch a hand edit, and the hash of each key merged into .claude/settings.json. Under seeds, the root files the sync created or added words to (cspell.json, project-words.txt); the target owns those, so they are not hashed. Do not edit.",
